    "body": "This PR contains the following updates:\n\n| Package | Change | [Age](https://docs.renovatebot.com/merge-confidence/) | [Confidence](https://docs.renovatebot.com/merge-confidence/) |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| [github.com/go-playground/validator/v10](https://redirect.github.com/go-playground/validator) | `v10.30.3` → `v10.30.4` | ![age](https://developer.mend.io/api/mc/badges/age/go/github.com%2fgo-playground%2fvalidator%2fv10/v10.30.4?slim=true) | ![confidence](https://developer.mend.io/api/mc/badges/confidence/go/github.com%2fgo-playground%2fvalidator%2fv10/v10.30.3/v10.30.4?slim=true) |\n\n---\n\n### Release Notes\n\n<details>\n<summary>go-playground/validator (github.com/go-playground/validator/v10)</summary>\n\n### [`v10.30.4`](https://redirect.github.com/go-playground/validator/releases/tag/v10.30.4)\n\n[Compare Source](https://redirect.github.com/go-playground/validator/compare/v10.30.3...v10.30.4)\n\n#### What's Changed\n\n- Add English translations for prefix and suffix validators by [@&#8203;morning-verlu](https://redirect.github.com/morning-verlu) in [#&#8203;1583](https://redirect.github.com/go-playground/validator/pull/1583)\n- chore(deps): bump golang.org/x/crypto from 0.52.0 to 0.53.0 by [@&#8203;dependabot](https://redirect.github.com/dependabot)\\[bot] in [#&#8203;1589](https://redirect.github.com/go-playground/validator/pull/1589)\n- chore(deps): bump actions/checkout from 6 to 7 by [@&#8203;dependabot](https://redirect.github.com/dependabot)\\[bot] in [#&#8203;1591](https://redirect.github.com/go-playground/validator/pull/1591)\n- chore(deps): bump golang.org/x/net from 0.38.0 to 0.55.0 in /\\_examples/validate\\_fn by [@&#8203;dependabot](https://redirect.github.com/dependabot)\\[bot] in [#&#8203;1593](https://redirect.github.com/go-playground/validator/pull/1593)\n- chore(deps): bump golang.org/x/crypto from 0.53.0 to 0.54.0 by [@&#8203;dependabot](https://redirect.github.com/dependabot)\\[bot] in [#&#8203;1598](https://redirect.github.com/go-playground/validator/pull/1598)\n- chore(deps): bump golang.org/x/crypto from 0.51.0 to 0.52.0 in /\\_examples/validate\\_fn by [@&#8203;dependabot](https://redirect.github.com/dependabot)\\[bot] in [#&#8203;1597](https://redirect.github.com/go-playground/validator/pull/1597)\n- feat: URN RFC 8141 by [@&#8203;leodido](https://redirect.github.com/leodido) in [#&#8203;1224](https://redirect.github.com/go-playground/validator/pull/1224)\n- chore(deps): bump actions/setup-go from 6 to 7 by [@&#8203;dependabot](https://redirect.github.com/dependabot)\\[bot] in [#&#8203;1601](https://redirect.github.com/go-playground/validator/pull/1601)\n- chore(deps): bump github.com/leodido/go-urn from 1.4.0 to 1.5.0 by [@&#8203;dependabot](https://redirect.github.com/dependabot)\\[bot] in [#&#8203;1606](https://redirect.github.com/go-playground/validator/pull/1606)\n- chore(deps): bump github.com/gabriel-vasile/mimetype from 1.4.13 to 1.4.15 by [@&#8203;dependabot](https://redirect.github.com/dependabot)\\[bot] in [#&#8203;1605](https://redirect.github.com/go-playground/validator/pull/1605)\n- fix(fqdn): enforce maximum DNS name length by [@&#8203;matheusgb](https://redirect.github.com/matheusgb) in [#&#8203;1603](https://redirect.github.com/go-playground/validator/pull/1603)\n- fix: use idiomatic \"at most\" in English max/lte messages by [@&#8203;snowyukitty](https://redirect.github.com/snowyukitty) in [#&#8203;1600](https://redirect.github.com/go-playground/validator/pull/1600)\n- chore(deps): bump golang.org/x/crypto from 0.54.0 to 0.55.0 by [@&#8203;dependabot](https://redirect.github.com/dependabot)\\[bot] in [#&#8203;1612](https://redirect.github.com/go-playground/validator/pull/1612)\n- test: cover startsnotwith/endsnotwith, RegisterStructValidationMapRules, and float32 comparator branches by [@&#8203;nguyenvantuan2391996](https://redirect.github.com/nguyenvantuan2391996) in [#&#8203;1609](https://redirect.github.com/go-playground/validator/pull/1609)\n- docs: clarify fieldexcludes behavior by [@&#8203;1678092075](https://redirect.github.com/1678092075) in [#&#8203;1610](https://redirect.github.com/go-playground/validator/pull/1610)\n- feat(translations): add Armenian translations by [@&#8203;tigran90](https://redirect.github.com/tigran90) in [#&#8203;1604](https://redirect.github.com/go-playground/validator/pull/1604)\n- ci: Fix the linter version by [@&#8203;zemzale](https://redirect.github.com/zemzale) in [#&#8203;1617](https://redirect.github.com/go-playground/validator/pull/1617)\n\n#### New Contributors\n\n- [@&#8203;morning-verlu](https://redirect.github.com/morning-verlu) made their first contribution in [#&#8203;1583](https://redirect.github.com/go-playground/validator/pull/1583)\n- [@&#8203;matheusgb](https://redirect.github.com/matheusgb) made their first contribution in [#&#8203;1603](https://redirect.github.com/go-playground/validator/pull/1603)\n- [@&#8203;snowyukitty](https://redirect.github.com/snowyukitty) made their first contribution in [#&#8203;1600](https://redirect.github.com/go-playground/validator/pull/1600)\n- [@&#8203;nguyenvantuan2391996](https://redirect.github.com/nguyenvantuan2391996) made their first contribution in [#&#8203;1609](https://redirect.github.com/go-playground/validator/pull/1609)\n- [@&#8203;1678092075](https://redirect.github.com/1678092075) made their first contribution in [#&#8203;1610](https://redirect.github.com/go-playground/validator/pull/1610)\n- [@&#8203;tigran90](https://redirect.github.com/tigran90) made their first contribution in [#&#8203;1604](https://redirect.github.com/go-playground/validator/pull/1604)\n\n**Full Changelog**: <https://github.com/go-playground/validator/compare/v10.30.3...v10.30.4>\n\n</details>\n\n---\n\n### Configuration\n\n📅 **Schedule**: (UTC)\n\n- Branch creation\n  - At any time (no schedule defined)\n- Automerge\n  - At any time (no schedule defined)\n\n🚦 **Automerge**: Disabled by config. Please merge this manually once you are satisfied.\n\n♻ **Reb